00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:28.440
- You want me to quantify this?

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:29.470
- Oh, snap.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:30.303
- You ready, you ready?

00:20:30.303 --> 00:20:31.136
