the Moon on $100 billion.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:51.913
The entire US interstate
system is $100 billion.

00:20:52.997 --> 00:20:54.430
Okay.

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:56.810
100 billion is

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:59.570
1/6

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:03.040
