00:21:09.923 --> 00:21:10.756
It just is.

00:21:10.756 --> 00:21:11.589
- You should've never told me that.

00:21:11.589 --> 00:21:13.130
- No, I used to judge that
but I stopped judging,

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:13.963
