rules/laws of physics?

00:40:25.497 --> 00:40:28.867
"Laws of motion,
thermodynamics, et cetera.

00:40:28.867 --> 00:40:33.297
"Or is it once that it's
a law and it's established

00:40:33.297 --> 00:40:37.450
